\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl276\slmult1\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \{he na me honhom kuro ne fi w]? 
\par \{he na me kra benya daa ahot]? 
\par Mehu saa kuro yi w] wiase a 
\par amane ne b]ne remma h] anaa?
\par Dabi, dabi, ebi nni ha, 
\par na me kra kuro no w] soro noh]. 
